  "original_title": "Eden's Choice",
  "overview": "In a time when the abortion debate continues to divide culture, politics, and communities across America, this deeply emotional film cuts through the noise to tell a raw and unforgettable human story, one that challenges audiences to see the person behind the issue. EDEN’S CHOICE follows the journey of 13 year old Eden, a young girl facing abuse, poverty, and an unplanned pregnancy. As her family crumbles and her circumstances spiral beyond her control, Eden is forced to make a decision that will shape the rest of her life. Choosing courage over fear, she makes the life altering decision to choose life. What follows is a powerful journey of sacrifice, perseverance, and ultimately, redemption, as Eden comes to understand the profound impact of her choice years later.",
